537	TLS	TM_RPCH	Timor-Leste	Volume of imports of goods and services	Percent change of volume of imports refers to the aggregate change in the quantities of total imports whose characteristics are unchanged. The goods and services and their prices are held constant, therefore changes are due to changes in quantities only. [Export and Import Price Index Manual: Theory and Practice, Glossary]	Percent change	Units																																																					
